=== scopes.go context around 90-120 (which token kinds get session scope) ===
// scopes pkg/op advertises in discovery. Non-admin users get LoginScopesFor
// (which strips entire:ops-access) — see that function for the per-user
// resolution policy.
//
// Notably absent: entire:sa-session. A login JWT is a human's session
